119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8z\"></path></svg>			\n									OUR Mission\n					</a>\n									<h2>Everything you need to Know about Oublé</h2>							\n								<figure><img src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-About-img_1.jpg\" alt=\"HomePage-About-img_1.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-About-img_3.jpg\" alt=\"HomePage-About-img_3.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-About-img_5.jpg\" alt=\"HomePage-About-img_5.jpg\" /></figure>			\n								<figure><img src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-About-img_2.jpg\" alt=\"HomePage-About-img_2.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-About-img_4.jpg\" alt=\"HomePage-About-img_4.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-About-img_6.jpg\" alt=\"HomePage-About-img_6.jpg\" /></figure>			\n							<h5>@OUBLE_OFFICIAL</h5>							\n									<h3>\n							Colors &amp; Shapes 						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						The bottles come in different colors, materials, and shapes. So, you can find the one that fits your needs and lifestyle exactly.					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Chemical-free						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Oublé Bottles are made from natural materials. We use only glass and stainless steel to create a chemical-free product for improved taste and longevity.					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Functionality						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Oublé Bottles maintain temperature for both hot and cold beverages. It’s also resistant to leaks  and can be easily disassembled for thorough cleaning.					</p>\n							<h2>Sneak peek Into our new collection</h2>															<img width=\"387\" height=\"380\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_1.jpg 387w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_1-300x295.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 387px) 100vw, 387px\" />																										<img width=\"505\" height=\"501\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_2.jpg 505w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_2-300x298.jpg 300w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_2-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 505px) 100vw, 505px\" />																										<img width=\"492\" height=\"514\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_3.jpg 492w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_3-287x300.jpg 287w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" />																										<img width=\"387\" height=\"394\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_4.jpg 387w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Gallery-img_4-295x300.jpg 295w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 387px) 100vw, 387px\" />																					<a href=\"https://library.elementor.com/eco-friendly-water-bottles-flexbox/gallery/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8z\"></path></svg>			\n									view more\n					</a>\n									<h2>What others say about Oublé </h2>							\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n							\"I felt connected to Oublé approach so I decided switch to Sustainable bottle and i love it!!\"\n														Luti Bron\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9733;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n							״I am very happy with my purchase, the bottle with me everywhere I go. Highly recommend!!״\n														Oliy Sew\n							<h2>Follow the Story</h2>							\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<img width=\"171\" height=\"171\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_1.jpg 171w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_1-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" />\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<img width=\"171\" height=\"171\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_2.jpg 171w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_2-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" />\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<img width=\"171\" height=\"171\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_3.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_3.jpg 171w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_3-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" />\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<img width=\"171\" height=\"171\" src=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_4.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_4.jpg 171w, http://damarowen-test.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HomePage-Footer-Gallery-img_4-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" />\n			</figure>\n									<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											Instagram  \n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											twitter\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"#\">\n											facebook\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<h1>Oublé</h1>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','43-revision-v1','','','2026-06-02 10:27:24','2026-06-02 10:27:24','',43,'http://damarowen-test.local/?p=83',0,'revision','',0);
